OL,3,GNEWSA'Long-term gain' promised as
OL,4,Atunnel track replaced
OL,5,
OL,6,FEngineers are working around the clock
OL,7,Fto replace the specialist track in a
OL,8,Frailway tunnel in nine days.
OL,10,FServices between Tonbridge and Wadhurst
OL,11,Fhave been suspended since Saturday,
OL,12,Fwith replacement buses operating for
OL,13,Fpassengers.
OL,15,FSoutheastern spokesman Tom Moore said
OL,16,Fthe closure over the school holiday was
OL,17,F"short-term pain for longer-term gain",
OL,18,Fadding that the only alternative would
OL,19,Fhave involved closures over multiple
OL,20,Fweekends.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
